量采集与电能质量分析等场景。本次发明专利的取得不会对公司近期经营产生重大影响，有利于公司充分发挥主导产品的知识产权优势，形成持续创新机制，保持公司技术 领先地位，进一步提升公司的核心竞争力。 特此公告。 青岛东软载波科技股份有限公司 董事会 2026 年 11 月 26 日 [点击查看PDF原文] 提示：本网不保证其真实性和客观性，一切有关该股的有效信息，以交易所的公告为准，敬请投资者注意风险。","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":2,"body":"complete","reportedComments":2,"commentSource":"public-web-and-child-pagination","bodySource":"embedded-post-article","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"300183","comments":[{"id":"9984087604","text":"专利！","at":"2026-11-26 19:51:17","replyTo":null},{"id":"9984047253","text":"恶心？","at":"2026-11-26 18:06:11","replyTo":null}]},{"id":"1802081725","objectId":"stock300183","title":"抄底别抄此股，抄了就得被套，跌满整个牛市，不要幻想能抄到底！","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,300183,1802081725.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 15:51:30","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":33,"commentCount":1,"content":"抄底别抄此股，抄了就得被套，跌满整个牛市，不要幻想能抄到底！","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":1,"body":"complete","reportedComments":1,"commentSource":"public-web-and-child-pagination","bodySource":"embedded-post-article","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"300183","comments":[{"id":"9983988116","text":"瞎说，韭菜们这两年在这股上赚的盆满钵满，赶快卖房抄底，富贵在此一举","at":"2026-11-26 16:02:10","replyTo":null}]},{"id":"1802079786","objectId":"stock300183","title":"业绩太差。参舆的少。随大盘走，没希望。","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,300183,1802079786.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 15:46:08","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":20,"commentCount":0,"content":"业绩太差。参舆的少。随大盘走，没希望。","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":0,"body":"complete","reportedComments":0,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"embedded-post-article","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"300183","comments":[]},{"id":"1802057910","objectId":"stock300183","title":"上市16年，今天收盘价创15年新低。","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,300183,1802057910.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 15:04:29","sour